sr` entrypoint tests covering the override being ignored without a valid token, ignored when only `x-vercel-isr` is set, and applied when the valid token is present.\n\n## Docs\n\n- No docs update needed. The token and ISR routing params are internal implementation details with no public API change.\n","created_at":"2026-07-13T19:09:18Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T20:14:36Z","closed_at":"2026-07-13T20:14:34Z","merged_at":"2026-07-13T20:14:34Z","merge_commit_sha":"3a43cf0f3690a8e33cb30109bc5165611cf38fcd","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":3559102393,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q87UI5e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20integration","name":"pkg: integration","color":"b4a8d1","default":false,"description":"Related to any renderer integration (scope)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/17370/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/17370/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/17370/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/statuses/b6eb4d1a3c9d1ba05d7e86fc193c9d3ef6c02e3c","head":{"label":"withastro:vercel-isr-path-hardening","ref":"vercel-isr-path-hardening","sha":"b6eb4d1a3c9d1ba05d7e86fc193c9d3ef6c02e3c","user":{"login":"withastro","id":44914786,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjQ0OTE0Nzg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44914786?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/withastro","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/withastro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/withastro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/withastro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.git